# Low Water, Act 2: the second night, new places, events. Director's file, 2026-10-17. Private.
# Calendar: design/PRODUCTION.md section 8, night 2. Plan: design/ACT2-PLAN.md.

@night n2
low: 23:46 -0.42
high: 05:58 5.1
at: 19:10 temp 3
at: 19:10 fog 0
at: 19:10 rain 0
at: 19:10 wind.speed 2
at: 23:00 temp 0
at: 01:00 frost 1
at: 01:00 temp -2
at: 05:30 fog 0.04
at: 06:02 temp -1

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the night's events
@event ev2.switch
at: 19:10
do: set(ev2.switch)

@event ev2.fisk
at: 19:40
do: set(ev2.fisk_here)

@event ev2.rook_out
at: 22:00
do: set(ev2.rook_out)

@event ev2.rook_back
at: 23:00
do: set(ev2.rook_back)

@event ev2.errand
at: 23:00
do: set(ev2.errand)

@event ev2.low
at: 23:22
do: set(ev2.low_open)

@event ev2.procession
at: 01:00
do: set(ev2.procession); quest(a2.bulb, walking)

@event ev2.shelf_reply
at: 02:00
when: has(day.wrote)
nar: The tube thumps out of hours. Pip runs the canister to the assessor herself. Typed, with the e sticking: SHELF: THE CLERK IS THE CLERK. ASSESSOR TO CONFINE ENQUIRIES TO THE LOSS.
do: set(ev2.shelf_reply)

@event ev2.test
at: 03:00
do: set(ev2.test)

@event ev2.tube
at: 04:00
do: set(ev2.tube_thump)

@event ev2.smoke
at: 05:30
do: set(ev2.sea_smoke)

@event ev2.dawn
at: 06:02
go: dawn2.start

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- word comes to Lamb (signpost for the muster and Sallis, 2026-10-17)
@event ev2.word_boat
at: 23:05
when: !seen(quay2.muster) & !has(a2.afloat)
go: word.boat
